This file keeps web/dist present in a clean checkout.

cmd/opendesigner embeds this directory with //go:embed, and that directive is a
compile-time error when the directory does not exist. Without this file, `go
build ./...` would fail on a fresh clone until someone ran `pnpm --dir web
build` -- so the tracked placeholder is what keeps the Go build independent of
the frontend build.

The binary that results embeds no editor and says so on "/", see
internal/server/webui.go.
